From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:16:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Connect the agency's mailbox (Gmail, iCloud, Yahoo or any
 IMAP/SMTP, app password stored encrypted): messages and follow-ups are sent
 from it in one click (follow-ups in the same thread), and replies are read
 from the inbox every few minutes: the card moves to Replied by itself and the
 follow-ups stop

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
